   <img width=\"98%\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/billyg270/conveyor-belts/-/raw/master/readme_assets/preview_images.png\" alt=\"Discord\" data-testid=\"image\" />\n</a>\n\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n\n<h2>合成配方</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n    <img width=\"33%\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 10px solid black; border-radius:40px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-right: 5px;\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/903385978482360320/958339548885164053/unknown.png\" alt=\"木质传送带\" data-testid=\"image\"/><img width=\"32%\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 10px solid black; border-radius:40px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-right: 5px;\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/903385978482360320/958339626987294770/unknown.png\" alt=\"铁质传送带\" data-testid=\"image\"/><img width=\"33%\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 10px solid black; border-radius:40px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-right: 5px;\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/903385978482360320/958339652950065172/unknown.png\" alt=\"金质传送带\" data-testid=\"image\"/>\n    <br />\n    <img width=\"33%\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 10px solid black; border-radius:40px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-right: 5px;\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/billyg270/conveyor-belts/-/raw/master/readme_assets/wood_belt_uses.png\" alt=\"过滤与上坡\" data-testid=\"image\"/>\n    <br />\n    <img width=\"33%\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 10px solid black; border-radius:40px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-right: 5px;\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/billyg270/conveyor-belts/-/raw/master/readme_assets/upward_wood_belt_uses.png\" alt=\"下坡\" data-testid=\"image\"/><img width=\"33%\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 10px solid black; border-radius:40px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-right: 5px;\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/billyg270/conveyor-belts/-/raw/master/readme_assets/downward_wood_belt_uses.png\" alt=\"坡道转常规\" data-testid=\"image\"/>\n</div>\n\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n\n<h2>视频教程</h2>\n\n<ul style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n    <li>\n        <a href=\"https://youtu.be/txjlByWaO9A\">红石：传送带可通过红石信号禁用</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <a href=\"https://youtu.be/WlYpflEd5pQ\">筛选：未设置过滤时，物品将均匀分配到两个输出端</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <a href=\"https://youtu.be/p8wqFzgI7Zo\">筛选：单侧设置过滤后，该物品将进入对应输出端，其余物品进入另一输出端</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <a href=\"https://youtu.be/HToJ1V1V7DU\">筛选：两侧均设置过滤时，匹配过滤器的物品进入对应输出端；若物品与两个过滤器均不匹配，将发出提示音表示堵塞</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <a href=\"https://youtu.be/P-Aj1fbJZYc\">合并：物品从漏斗或其他传送带进入传送带时，将自动交错汇合</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <a href=\"https://youtu.be/oxQ9kWJKpd4\">放置：传送带默认背对玩家放置，按住Shift键可使其面向玩家</a>\n    </li>\n</ul>",
